    "macOS also switches Spaces with three-finger swipes. Set “Swipe between full-screen apps” to four fingers." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS wechselt Spaces auch mit Dreifingergesten. Stelle „Zwischen Apps im Vollbildmodus streichen“ auf vier Finger."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS también cambia de Space deslizando tres dedos. Ajusta “Deslizar entre apps a pantalla completa” a cuatro dedos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS change aussi de Space par balayage à trois doigts. Réglez « Balayer entre les apps en plein écran » sur quatre doigts."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOSでも3本指のスワイプで Spaces を切り替えられます。「フルスクリーンアプリケーション間をスワイプ」を4本指に設定してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS에서도 세 손가락 쓸어넘기기로 스페이스를 전환할 수 있습니다. “전체 화면 앱 간 쓸어넘기기”를 네 손가락으로 설정하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O macOS também troca de Space com deslizes de três dedos. Defina “Deslizar entre apps em tela cheia” como quatro dedos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 也会用三指轻扫切换空间。请将“在全屏幕 App 之间轻扫”设为四指。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS needs you to allow Glide under Login Items." : {
